What this fork changes

YIMA tracks a single person's cycle. Ritu extends it with multi-person
tracking: several people (self, partner, family, friends) can each keep their
own private cycle history, settings, daily logs, and predictions inside one
app. It also adds per-person reminders and a "For me / For someone else" onboarding
flow. All cycle data continues to be stored locally on the device.

The upstream project, its authors, and the original design are credited to
